@startuml
!theme plain
title Smart Auto — Sequence: request, response, chat + Realtime tables

actor Requester as R
actor Driver as D
participant "Flutter app" as App
database "requests" as Req
database "request_responses" as RR
database "chats" as Chat
database "messages" as Msg
participant "Supabase Realtime" as RT

R -> App: Create request (status open)
App -> Req: INSERT
Req --> App: request id

D -> App: Browse open requests
App -> Req: SELECT\n(RLS: open or own)
Req --> App: list

D -> App: Submit interest
App -> RR: INSERT (pending)
RR --> App: ok

R -> App: Accept driver
App -> RR: UPDATE → accepted
App -> Req: UPDATE → accepted

R -> App: Open chat
App -> Chat: INSERT / SELECT\n(unique request_id)
Chat --> App: chat id

R -> App: Send message
App -> Msg: INSERT
Msg --> RT: WAL → broadcast
RT --> D: new row

D -> App: Reply
App -> Msg: INSERT
Msg --> RT: broadcast
RT --> R: new row

note right of RT
  Publication includes **messages**,
  **requests**, **request_responses**
end note

@enduml
